 "text": "1. BIMSTEC's headquarters is in Dhaka. **C**\n2. For the circle x² + y² + 2gx + 2fy + c = 0, the chord cut on the y-axis has length 2√(f² − c). **D**\n3. The dense lichen mat on slopes is called reindeer moss. **A**\n4. The letter positions are F=6, I=9, M=13, P=16, T=20. The gaps alternate +3, +4, so the next is 20 + 3 = 23, which is W. **A**\n5. The BBC's office was Bush House. **D**\n6. Steel has the highest elasticity of these. **C**\n7. The conjunct in জ্ঞান is জ্ + ঞ. **C**\n8. In a lead storage cell, PbSO₄ is reduced (to Pb during charging). **C**\n9. The lightest gas diffuses fastest. CH₄ (16) is lighter than NH₃ (17), so CH₄ wins. **B**\n10. \"তিনি রাগে গরগর করছেন\" is best rendered as \"He is boiling with rage.\" **D**\n11. 81 = 3⁴ = (√3)⁸, so log base √3 of 81 is 8. **C**\n12. Waterloo is in Belgium. **D**\n13. Avogadro's law is not a law of chemical combination. **C**\n14. Emitted energy is proportional to T⁴. A ratio of 16:1 means the temperature ratio is 2:1, so Q = 1600/2 = 800 K. **A**\n15. অসুয়া means envy, so it is not a synonym of ঈপ্সা. **A**\n\n{\"answers\": {\"810280d0-a0f8-4950-91ff-6ac7b92623c2-59723\": \"C\", \"815030d7-4c65-4841-8e9d-d95ba5af96cd-85550\": \"D\", \"82483b9e-6995-45bc-826d-6be5734374d2-68867\": \"A\", \"82690f9c-99db-4a82-a197-44485e220416-129544\": \"A\", \"828ba56f-1bc8-4ce9-9f57-d30cfd488b17-73450\": \"D\", \"834b6c70-5aae-426f-ad88-e7fa1c102f6a-52376\": \"C\", \"83d04104-a4e5-4d5d-a5fc-5228d8100284-90422\": \"C\", \"84877c82-ca0c-4390-a4c5-ea8ad1b18d43-103504\": \"C\", \"863c5d34-029d-443b-a54e-c96c1e1ab46a-13867\": \"B\", \"8658ca46-a875-45eb-8c52-3f18a05be4ef-47105\": \"D\", \"87414d68-f9ea-4ab0-8bb7-4b753c5e3002-99919\": \"C\", \"89701f30-73fe-4492-bec9-b8528692025e-121889\": \"D\", \"897af77b-6414-496b-a81c-e0b5a435942f-76425\": \"C\", \"89812516-f0f1-44cd-9665-f969ca7fc6eb-135572\": \"A\", \"89b398d4-89b5-41ad-85da-55a3546f874a-25591\": \"A\"}}",
